    "vision": {
      "answer": "Modern skyscraper development is heavily concentrated in Asia, which accounts for 12 of the 15 tallest buildings shown and includes nearly all of the highest-ranked towers. North America has only two entries and Europe one, suggesting that today’s supertall-building boom is predominantly Asian.",
